    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectFound? THEN\n\t\t\tDO ApproachObject\n\tELSE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectInReach? THEN\n\t\t\tDO GrabObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO CheckObjectProperties\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsDestinationReached? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO PlaceObject\n\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
